comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T08:57:55.010Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-05: searched every status for Auto Release run 30978379616,fresh-clone merge-driver parity,build bootstrap,and tracker measurement. pm-ei6x66 is the broader unfulfilled local/hosted registry contract; pm-e70zh5 owns chronic release reliability. No item separately owned this concrete build-plus-merge-driver prerequisite."
  "2026-08-05T08:58:42.318Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-08-05: runReleaseGates builds the checkout, invokes the freshly built dist/cli.js merge install --no-extensions, then executes the remaining gates. The focused linked release suite passed 34/34; exact-head hosted static and Windows gates passed; local tracker measurement covered 2,317 items with zero violations; docs match the executable order."
  "2026-08-05T09:19:07.586Z","harness:codex","Tracker-gate evidence: the newly linked clean-clone measurement first failed honestly because this new item lacked estimated_minutes and therefore formed an undeclared validation population. I fixed the item metadata itself (90 minutes), without raising a ratchet ceiling, then reran the linked test successfully: merge drivers installed and tracker measurement reported zero violations over 2,318 items. The focused release pipeline suite also passes 34/34."
